WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.170
Welcome to Manulife Vitality Stories! 

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:09.576
Once upon a time, Matthew wondered, “How do I use the Manulife Vitality app?” 

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:12.679
So he opened up to Chapter 1.   

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.383
First, he needed to download the app.  

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:21.654
It’s simple! He just went to the App Store or Google Play and found the one called “Manulife Vitality”.

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:26.059
Now that he had the app, in Chapter 2 it was time to try it out!  

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:30.730
The first thing he saw was the home screen – where everything he needed was at his fingertips! 

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:39.205
He could see his status level, number of points, navigation buttons along the bottom, some posts, his Weekly Target progress and more.  

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:45.845
Clicking “Profile” opened up a new right navigation to access more features, including settings. 

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:53.553
Matthew couldn’t wait to earn Vitality Points – and Chapter 3 shows the app was just bursting with ways to earn them.  

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:56.623
Check these out! 

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:04.030
Now let’s take a quick look at how Matthew completed his Vitality Health Review.  

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:13.473
He clicked “Activities,” then “Reviews” and “Vitality Health Review.”  

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:20.613
From there, he clicked “Start review” and answered some questions on his way to earning a quick 500 points! 

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:28.221
Everything in the app was cool, but the most fun part had to be collecting rewards. So it’s time for Chapter 4. 

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:34.327
When Matthew reached his weekly activity goal, he earned a Vitality Spin and was notified on the home screen.  

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:40.967
He clicked “Rewards,” clicked to spin, then swiped to spin the wheel to automatically win gift cards or points! 

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:50.543
He answered the easy math question and, BOOM, he was a winner! 

00:01:52.445 --> 00:02:01.054
If he won a gift card, he would click the big pink button at the top of the Rewards screen to collect his digital gift card, with a code and PIN that he could use right away.  

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:11.598
And we close with Chapter 5, as Matthew knew that with all the points and rewards he could collect through the app, he’d live happily ever after! 

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:15.802
Want to check out more Manulife Vitality “how-to” stories?  

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:21.508
Click on one of the other videos you see here, then you could live happily ever after!  

